<title>UK: CeraBank sets 2.0 bln Lux franc step-up bond.</title>
<headline>CeraBank sets 2.0 bln Lux franc step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CeraBank and Banque et Caisse d'Epargne del'Etat (Lux).</p>
<p> BORROWER   CERABANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON    *4.50	MATURITY    29.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.65    PAY DATE  L-28.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMIT US/UK     GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORC MAJ    YES</p>
<p> YIELD	5.0 PCT.</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 29.APR.01 THEN STEPS-UP TO 7.0 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
